ue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期は、やはり紅葉も素敵なのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋のお花もとっても素敵なんです＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに、この時期はバラ ♭♭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花好きの私にとって、今の時期は行きたい場所がたくさんあります＞_＜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旧古河庭園、ひとえにバラと言っても、たくさんの種類があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても美しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、洋館っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まるで、御伽話の世界に出てくるようで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても可愛くて、癒されました（＾_＾）＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、この洋館の前では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今、秋バラの音楽会が開催されていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アコーディオンの演奏を見ながら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芝生のうえで、ゆったりのんびりアイスクリーム食べました( ^ω^ )あ～しあわせ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさに至福のとき！＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アコーディオンの音色はワルツが似合うねっ（＾Ｏ＾）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっかり魅了されてしまいました♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、こちらは日本庭園 ＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に美しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空気が本当に澄んでいてキレイで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼吸をするたびに、スーッと心の中が透明になっいく感じがしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自然には不思議な力を感じます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"池には鯉さんやカメさんやがいたりして、可愛かったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/1711253/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこもかしこも、ほんとにキレイすぎて、たくさん写真を撮ったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに載せきれないので＞_＜徐々にアップしていきたいと思います(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旧古河庭園の帰りに、飛鳥山から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都電荒川線に乗ってみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都会の街の中を走っていくのはちょっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議な感覚で、とっても楽しかったです＼(^o^)／☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p